@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = your-token-here
@noteId = 1

### 为当前用户尚未登记的旧笔记片段安排回填
POST {{base}}/notes/vector-sync/backfill
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 为当前用户指定笔记安排重新同步
POST {{base}}/notes/{{noteId}}/vector-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看指定笔记的同步状态和重试信息
GET {{base}}/notes/{{noteId}}/vector-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 手动重试失败的任务
POST {{base}}/notes/{{noteId}}/vector-sync/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 继续使用已有的笔记片段搜索接口
GET {{base}}/notes/chunks/search?question=Java接口
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
